free to suggest it.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-le=
ft:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'>[Med=
] Thanks for confirming. Maybe consider something such as : =C2=AB&nbsp;Except r=
elaxing a MUST on key_exchange values, this document does not require any mo=
dification to the base TLS specification.=E2=80=9C or similar.<o:p></o:p></span></=
i></b></p><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'fon=
t-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></b></p=
><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11=
.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'>Given that implication on base TLS spec, I=E2=80=
=99m afraid that the intended publication status should be reconsidered. </spa=
n></i></b><span style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:=
p></span></p></div><div><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><o:p>&nb=
sp;</o:p></p></div><blockquote style=3D'margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt'>=
<div><div><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><span lang=3DFR># IANA c=
onsiderations<br><br>Unless I missed something the document provides guidanc=
e for future<br>assignments. Shouldn=E2=80=99t a note be added to the TLS registry=
 to track this<br>guidance and/or add this document as a reference to the re=
gistry?<o:p></o:p></span></p></div></div></blockquote><div><p class=3DMsoNorma=
l style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><span lang=3DFR><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><=
div><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><span lang=3DFR>I do now know =
what text IANA would want to see here; my understanding from IANA's review i=
s that they have not requested any further changes.<o:p></o:p></span></p></d=
iv><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-=
bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-fam=
ily:"Courier New"'>[Med] Beyond what need to be recorded in an IANA registry=
, the main point is that this section sets guidance for future assignments a=
nd we need to make sure that guidance is followed.</span></i></b><o:p></o:p>=
</p><blockquote style=3D'margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt'><div><div><p cl=
ass=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><span lang=3DFR>As I=E2=80=99m there,<br><br>=
CURRENT:<br>For these entries in<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;the TLS Supported Groups reg=
istry, the &quot;Recommended&quot; column SHOULD be<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;N&q=
uot; and the &quot;DTLS-OK&quot; column SHOULD be &quot;Y&quot;.<br><br>I gu=
ess this should be the value used in the initial registration. The<br>recomm=
ended value may in theory evolve in the future (far future, maybe). If<br>so=
, can we make that explicit in the document?<o:p></o:p></span></p></div></di=
v></blockquote></div><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><span lang=3D=
FR><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><div><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-l=
eft:.5in'><span lang=3DFR>For what reasons do you expect this recommendation m=
ay evolve? &nbsp;I am not sure what text to write other than &quot;The recom=
mended value may change in the future&quot;, which I think is too vague.<o:p=
></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><b><i><span st=
yle=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'>[Med] I was actually sugges=
ting this change:<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mar=
gin-left:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"=
'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></i></b></p><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:=
.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'>OLD: th=
e &quot;Recommended&quot; column SHOULD be =E2=80=A6<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p>=
<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><b><i><span style=3D'font-size:11.=
0pt;font-family:"Courier New"'>NEW: the &quot;Recommended&quot; column SHOUL=
D in the initial registration be =E2=80=A6<o:p></o:p></span></i></b></p></div><div=
><p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:.5in'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p></div><div=
